' Notes for the restaurant and staff classes (class-model.iuml).
package entity {
  note right of Staff
    <b>Inheritance: one rule for every role</b>
    perform() runs an action only if the staff member has
    not acted this turn, and uses up the task only when the
    action succeeds, so a rejected choice can be retried.
    Host and Waiter both seat through Restaurant.seat(),
    so they can never disagree.
  end note

  note left of Restaurant
    <b>Composition</b> (filled diamonds)
    Restaurant creates its Tables (constructor) and its
    Orders (placeOrder()) and is their only owner; other
    objects only refer to them.
  end note
}
